{
  "name": "02 · Leads de Meta Lead Ads → app",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Leads de Meta (Facebook/Instagram)\n1. En **Meta · Nuevo lead** conecta tu credencial de Facebook Lead Ads y elige página y formulario (duplica el flujo si quieres uno por formulario, o deja «todos»).\n2. En la app, pon el **ID del formulario** en la ficha del cliente: así cada lead va a su despacho.\n3. Rellena el nodo **Config** (`LH_API_URL`, `LH_API_KEY`, `WHATSAPP_PHONE`, `WHATSAPP_APIKEY`).\n4. La app cualifica el lead y avisa al momento (flujo 04).",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "594d997d-ae10-418a-8d9a-fbe704e5857e",
      "name": "Nota a1c2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "newLead",
        "page": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "form": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "eaa1711d-e198-42a9-a009-49e29e307696",
      "name": "Meta · Nuevo lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.facebookLeadAdsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "864a734f-0d8f-40dc-bbe1-25ef4b2693ae"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Convierte el lead de Meta al formato de la app. Las preguntas del formulario se mandan tal cual\n// en \"answers\": la app reconoce deuda, acreedores, ingresos, provincia, etc. por palabras clave.\nreturn $input.all().map(({ json: l }) => {\n  let answers = {};\n  if (Array.isArray(l.field_data)) for (const f of l.field_data) answers[f.name] = Array.isArray(f.values) ? f.values.join(', ') : f.values;\n  else if (l.data && typeof l.data === 'object') answers = { ...l.data };\n  else for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(l)) if (typeof v !== 'object' && !/^[A-Z0-9_]+$/.test(k)) answers[k] = v; // sin los campos del nodo Config\n  const formId = l.form?.id ?? l.form_id ?? null;\n  return { json: {\n    source: 'meta',\n    form_id: formId ? String(formId) : undefined,\n    external_id: String(l.id ?? l.leadgen_id ?? ''),\n    campaign: l.campaign?.name ?? l.campaign_name ?? null,\n    ad_name: l.ad?.name ?? l.ad_name ?? null,\n    consent_at: l.created_time ?? new Date().toISOString(),\n    consent_text: 'Formulario de Meta Lead Ads' + (l.form?.name ? ' «' + l.form.name + '»' : ''),\n    answers,\n  } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "fc50ca79-cabc-47e7-9f7f-9bae7bdb64fa",
      "name": "Preparar lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.LH_API_URL }}/api/v1/leads",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.LH_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
      },
      "id": "af12d3a9-09b4-4351-a90d-d82b025b5552",
      "name": "Enviar lead a la app",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.callmebot.com/whatsapp.php",
        "options": {},
